<view class="qf-page">
  <!-- 营销 hero -->
  <view class="qf-hero">
    <view class="qf-hero-title">凤伯乐·鸡场直通车</view>
    <view class="qf-hero-sub">同区域内首批仅开放 15 个名额 · 严选合作，额满即止</view>
  </view>

  <view class="qf-intro card">
    <view class="bold" style="font-size: 30rpx;">尊敬的养殖场合作伙伴：</view>
    <view class="mt-8" style="line-height: 1.8;">
      <view>· 您是否希望稳定渠道，提升品牌溢价？</view>
      <view>· 您是否愿意用品质说话，直接对话实力采购商？</view>
    </view>
    <view class="mt-16 muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
      平台为最优质的养殖场，精准对接采购客户。通过线上招采会，让您直接向采购商展示实力与产品，砍掉所有中间环节，实现源头直采、面对面直接谈。
      <text class="brand-text">您卖得越好，我们才越好，和您同坐一条船。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="qf-feats card">
    <view class="feat-row">
      <view class="feat-icon">✅</view>
      <view class="flex-1">
        <view class="bold">精准匹配，只为高效成交</view>
        <view class="muted mt-8">根据您的产能、蛋品特色，从买家库中精准筛选、定向邀请 5-10 家最对口的实力采购商。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="feat-row">
      <view class="feat-icon">✅</view>
      <view class="flex-1">
        <view class="bold">专属策划，助您完美亮相</view>
        <view class="muted mt-8">专属会议经理共同设计流程，打磨展示亮点，制定竞争力"平台标准上车价"。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="feat-row">
      <view class="feat-icon">✅</view>
      <view class="flex-1">
        <view class="bold">C 位舞台，深度讲述您的故事</view>
        <view class="muted mt-8">整场会议您是唯一焦点。30-45 分钟全程由您主导，直播带买家"亲临"现代化鸡场，零距离展示品控细节。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="feat-row">
      <view class="feat-icon">✅</view>
      <view class="flex-1">
        <view class="bold">高效对接，杜绝无效社交</view>
        <view class="muted mt-8">提前为您扫清障碍，到场买家均已知悉您的概况，直接进入实质性洽谈。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 状态提示 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <text class="bold">当前状态</text>
      <text class="tag {{ statusCls }}">{{ statusText }}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ licenseStatus === 'approved' }}" class="muted mt-8" style="line-height: 1.7;">
      🎉 您的资质已通过审核，可直接发布货源、报价、收单，无需再次提交。
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{ licenseStatus === 'pending' }}" class="muted mt-8" style="line-height: 1.7;">
      ⏳ 资料已提交，平台正在审核中，结果将通过站内消息通知，无需重复提交。
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{ licenseStatus === 'rejected' }}" class="muted mt-8" style="line-height: 1.7; color: #ee0a24;">
      ⚠ 上次审核未通过，请根据下方表单完善资料后重新提交。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ !canEdit }}" class="row-between" style="margin-top: 16rpx; padding: 18rpx 0; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; font-size: 28rpx;" bindtap="toggleDetail">
      <text>📜 查看已提交资质详情</text>
      <text class="muted">{{ showDetail ? '收起 ▲' : '展开 ▼' }}</text>
    </view>
    <button wx:if="{{ licenseStatus === 'approved' && !editing }}" class="btn-plain mt-16" bindtap="startEdit">✏️ 修改资质并重新提交审核</button>
    <view wx:if="{{ editing }}" class="muted mt-8" style="font-size: 22rpx; color: #b78300;">修改后提交将重新进入审核，审核通过前仍按现有资质生效。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 已通过 / 审核中：只读详情 -->
  <view wx:if="{{ !canEdit && showDetail }}" class="card qf-detail-card">
    <view class="qf-section-title">📋 基础信息</view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">鸡场名称</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.name || '—' }}</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">联系人</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.contact_name || '—' }}</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">联系电话</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.contact_phone || '—' }}</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">所在省份</text><text class="qf-v">{{ provinces[provinceIndex] || '—' }}</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">详细地址</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.address || '—' }}</text></view>

    <view class="qf-section-title mt-16">🐔 养殖信息</view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">养殖规模</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.farm_size_int ? form.farm_size_int + ' 只' : '—' }}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{ form.daily_output }}" class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">日产量</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.daily_output }} 箱/天</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">主营蛋品</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.main_products || '—' }}</text></view>
    <view class="qf-kv"><text class="qf-k">营业执照号</text><text class="qf-v">{{ form.business_license || '—' }}</text></view>

    <view class="qf-section-title mt-16">📸 资质照片</view>
    <view wx:if="{{ form.license_photos.length }}" class="qf-photos-block">
      <view class="qf-photos-title">· 营业执照</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.license_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb qf-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" binderror="onThumbErr"
                 data-list="{{ form.license_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ form.farm_photos.length }}" class="qf-photos-block">
      <view class="qf-photos-title">· 鸡场实景</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.farm_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb qf-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" binderror="onThumbErr"
                 data-list="{{ form.farm_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ form.quarantine_photos.length }}" class="qf-photos-block">
      <view class="qf-photos-title">· 检疫合格证 / 其他资质</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.quarantine_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb qf-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" binderror="onThumbErr"
                 data-list="{{ form.quarantine_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ !form.license_photos.length && !form.farm_photos.length && !form.quarantine_photos.length }}" class="muted text-c" style="padding: 32rpx 0; font-size: 24rpx;">
      无已上传图片
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ thumbLoadErr }}" class="muted text-c" style="padding: 16rpx 24rpx; font-size: 22rpx; color: #ee0a24;">
      ⚠ 图片加载失败：请将服务器域名加进小程序后台「downloadFile 合法域名」白名单后重试。
    </view>
  </view>

  <block wx:if="{{ canEdit }}">
  <!-- 申请表 -->
  <view class="qf-form-title">认证鸡场申请填写</view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="input-row" id="field-name"><view class="label">鸡场名称 *</view><input value="{{ form.name }}" data-k="name" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="如：阳光散养鸡场" /></view>
    <view class="input-row" id="field-contact_name"><view class="label">联系人 *</view><input value="{{ form.contact_name }}" data-k="contact_name" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="鸡场负责人姓名" /></view>
    <view class="input-row" id="field-contact_phone"><view class="label">联系电话 *</view><input type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{ form.contact_phone }}" data-k="contact_phone" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="登录手机号" /></view>
    <view class="input-row"><view class="label">所在省份 *</view>
      <picker bindchange="pickProvince" value="{{ provinceIndex }}" range="{{ provinces }}">
        <view class="picker-val">{{ provinces[provinceIndex] }} ▾</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="input-row" id="field-address">
      <view class="label">详细地址 *</view>
      <input value="{{ form.address }}" data-k="address" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="点右侧地图选点 / 手填" />
      <text class="addr-map-btn" bindtap="pickAddrOnMap">📍 地图</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{ form.lat }}" class="muted" style="font-size: 22rpx; padding: 4rpx 0 8rpx;">📍 已定位：{{ form.lat }}, {{ form.lng }}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="input-row" id="field-farm_size_int"><view class="label">养殖规模 *</view>
      <input type="number" value="{{ form.farm_size_int }}" data-k="farm_size_int" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="存栏只数" /><text class="muted" style="margin-left: 8rpx;">只</text>
    </view>
    <view class="input-row"><view class="label">日产量</view>
      <input type="number" value="{{ form.daily_output }}" data-k="daily_output" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="日产量" /><text class="muted" style="margin-left: 8rpx;">箱/天</text>
    </view>
    <view class="input-row" id="field-main_products"><view class="label">主营蛋品 *</view><input value="{{ form.main_products }}" data-k="main_products" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="如：红壳·散养土鸡蛋、粉壳·谷物蛋" /></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="input-row" id="field-business_license"><view class="label">营业执照号 *</view><input value="{{ form.business_license }}" data-k="business_license" bindinput="onInput" bindblur="onInput" placeholder="统一社会信用代码" /></view>

    <view class="upload-block" id="field-license_photos">
      <view class="upload-title">营业执照照片 *</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.license_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" data-list="{{ form.license_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
          <view class="upload-del" catchtap="del" data-k="license_photos" data-i="{{ index }}">×</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{ form.license_photos.length < 2 }}" class="upload-add" bindtap="upload" data-k="license_photos" data-count="2">+</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="upload-block" id="field-farm_photos">
      <view class="upload-title">鸡场实景照（含养殖环境、饲料、检疫等）*</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.farm_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" data-list="{{ form.farm_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
          <view class="upload-del" catchtap="del" data-k="farm_photos" data-i="{{ index }}">×</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{ form.farm_photos.length < 9 }}" class="upload-add" bindtap="upload" data-k="farm_photos" data-count="9">+</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="upload-block">
      <view class="upload-title">检疫合格证 / 其他资质（可选）</view>
      <view class="upload-grid">
        <view wx:for="{{ form.quarantine_photos }}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb">
          <image src="{{ item }}" mode="aspectFill" bindtap="preview" data-list="{{ form.quarantine_photos }}" data-url="{{ item }}" />
          <view class="upload-del" catchtap="del" data-k="quarantine_photos" data-i="{{ index }}">×</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{ form.quarantine_photos.length < 5 }}" class="upload-add" bindtap="upload" data-k="quarantine_photos" data-count="5">+</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn" bindtap="submit" loading="{{ loading }}">提交审核</button>
  <view class="muted text-c mt-8" style="margin-bottom: 32rpx;">审核周期 1-3 个工作日，结果以站内消息通知</view>
  </block>
</view>
